Generative AI - 
Text, Image, audio, video - that looks like it was created by human.

	- How it works 
		○ It train on huge dataset(book, code, images)
		○ Uses models like Transformer(eg. GPT,LLaMA, Gemini, Calude)
		○ Learns Patterns, style and relationships in data- then create new example those fit those pattern.
		○ Examples:
			§ Text - ChatGPT writing easy or code .
			§ Image - DALLE , Midjourney generating picture.
			§ Audio - MusicLm creating song 
			§ Video - Sora(by OpenAI), RunwayML generating video clip


AI Agent 
	An AI system that can act autonomously , make decision, and perform task - often using Generative AI as one of its tool.
	
	- How it works
		○ Has goals, memory and tools
		○ Can reason, plan, and take action(e.g. browse the  web, send emails, write code, update files)
		○ Often uses generative AI models (like GPT) as the brain 
		○ 
			Example 
			AI agent  
			AutoGPT   - Runs Gpt to complete multi steps goal automatically
			Devin(by cognition) - Write, test, debug code automatically
			Chat gpt with action - Execute commands uses APIs, or searches the web
		○ Eg . It doesn’t just talk, it actually does things.
	
			 
